{
    "background_story": "Kylo was a renowned art curator known for his impeccable taste. He had a keen eye for spotting talented artists, but he was also notorious for being extremely selective about the pieces he chose to showcase. Kylo believed that true artistry was rare, and he would only feature works that truly spoke to him. His gallery became a benchmark for excellence, with artists clamoring to have their pieces displayed. Kylo's selective approach didn't just apply to art; he was also choosy about the company he kept, surrounding himself with like-minded individuals who shared his passion for creativity. Despite his discerning nature, Kylo was always willing to take risks on emerging artists, giving them a platform to shine. His selective eye had a profound impact on the art world, shaping the careers of countless creatives.",
